WP:DescVector
"Main battle tank. Sturdy, dependable, and happiest in groups."
END

WP:DescFabricator
"Construction vehicle. Builds and repairs Meridian structures."
END

WP:DescPowerArray
"Generates power for the base. Production stalls without it."
END

WP:DescVehiclePlant
"Produces Meridian armor: the Vector, Outrider, and Zenith."
END

WP:DescOutrider
"Fast recon vehicle. Light gun, long sightlines, thin skin."
END

WP:DescZenith
"Long-range siege gun. Devastating at a distance, helpless up close."
END

WP:DescVulture
"Jackal raider. Cheap, quick, and vicious in a pack."
END

WP:DescMongrel
"Jackal battle tank. Scrap-built, but it hits like the real thing."
END

WP:DescRigger
"Salvage rig. Builds and repairs Jackal structures."
END

WP:DescBulwark
"Automated defense turret. Holds the line while your armor is away."
END

WP:DescChopShop
"Produces Jackal vehicles: the Mongrel and the Vulture."
END

WP:DescWatchpost
"Fortified tower. Watches the perimeter and fires on anything hostile."
END

